<title>NETHERLANDS: ATHLON 1996 NET RISES 15 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>ATHLON 1996 NET RISES 15 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    10.50 vs   9.69</p>
<p>    Net profit			    21.4  vs  18.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  3.67 vs   3.40</p>
<p>    Turnover			     791    vs 696</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    24.4  vs  20.2</p>
<p>    Associates' income		   5.1  vs   5.0</p>
<p>    Tax					8.6  vs   7.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Automobile group Athlon Groep NV previously said it</p>
<p>expected a profit rise in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
